<title>INDIA: India says cuts ferro-nickel import duty to 10 pct.</title>
<headline>India says cuts ferro-nickel import duty to 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Wednesday he proposed to cut import duty on ferro-nickel to 10 percent from 20 percent.</p>
<p>The finance minister told parliament the measure was being taken to provide relief to the steel industry.</p>
